NIVO78 WEBSITE STANDARDS — SAME PROMISE, SAME PLACES,
SAME LOOK

\================================================================================



Through-line on the web (matches app)

\- Utility-first, plain language — legal and support
pages are scannable reference, not marketing fluff.

\- Same local-first promise visible on support and
privacy pages unless the product explicitly requires an account.

\- No trackers, behavioral analytics, or silent data
collection on product legal/support pages unless disclosed in privacy policy.

\- Web copy matches shipped app behavior in the current
build — updocs keeps app, in-repo HTML, and hosted KB aligned.

\- Comprehensive SEO on every public page: title, meta
description (\~160 characters), canonical URL, Open Graph, and Twitter cards —
mandatory in the same pass as any web copy change (see WEB SEO section).



Required pages per product (in-repo staging under
code/Website/{product}/)

\- index.html          
— product legal & support hub (links to privacy, terms, support
center)

\- privacy/index.html  
— full privacy policy (Partner Center / store listing URL target)

\- terms/index.html    
— terms of use (effective date + version)

\- support/index.html  
— support center landing (security overview, contact, legal links, KB
entry)

\- legal.css           
— shared Nivo78 legal-page stylesheet (imports
code/Website/\_shared/n78\_legal\_privacy\_header.css; do not one-off per page)



Privacy policy first two lines (ALL products —
mandatory)

\- Every privacy policy page (in-repo HTML, hosted PHP,
store listing URL target) MUST open with exactly these two lines:

  1. h1 — text
must be “Privacy Policy” (document title; never the product name alone).

  2.
p.policy-product-name — full public product title (e.g. App Publishing
Assistant, N78-Ops).

\- Typography contract (shared CSS — do not duplicate
with one-off sizes):

  - Canonical
sheet: code/Website/\_shared/n78\_legal\_privacy\_header.css (N78APA in-repo).

  - Hosted
mirror: Website/assets/css/n78\_legal\_privacy\_header.css.

  - In-repo
product legal.css MUST @import the shared sheet (APA:
../\_shared/n78\_legal\_privacy\_header.css).

  - Hosted PHP
MUST link the shared sheet and call
n78\_render\_privacy\_policy\_header($productTitle)

    from
Website/include/n78\_privacy\_policy\_header.php.

\- Tokens (--privacy-h1-size 1.75rem;
\--privacy-product-name-size calc(1.5rem - 4pt); --privacy-tagline-size 1rem):

  - Line 1 and
line 2 use the same font-weight (600) and letter-spacing (-0.01em) as the
Privacy Policy h1.

  - Line 2 is
sized between the h1 and the Local-first philosophy-tagline (line 3 when
present).

\- Product-specific colors may override on hosted theme
pages; size and weight MUST NOT drift per product.



Hosted URLs (must match in-app support URL registry
and store listings)

\- Product hub: 
https\://nivo78.com/{product}/

\- Privacy:     
https\://nivo78.com/{product}/privacy/

\- Terms:       
https\://nivo78.com/{product}/terms/

\- Support:     
https\://nivo78.com/{product}/support/

\- Help KB:     
articles under support path when the product exports a knowledge base
(sibling Website repo)





